---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/') 
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL.slice(0, -1) 
  : import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section id="fundador" class="earlify-founder section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="founder-card glass-card">
      <div class="founder-top">
        <div class="avatar-wrapper">
          <div class="avatar-ring">
            <div class="avatar-content">
              <img src={`${baseUrl}/assets/dr-frank-betances.jpg`} alt="Dr. Frank Alberto Betances Reinoso · Fundador & CEO de Earlify Health S.L." class="avatar-img" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="founder-info">
          <div class="badge-row">
            <span class="badge badge-purple">👨‍⚕️ Fundador &amp; CEO · Earlify Health S.L.</span>
            <span class="badge badge-cyan">🩺 FEA Otorrinolaringología Infantil</span>
            <span class="badge badge-emerald">🔬 Doctorando USC</span>
          </div>

          <h2 class="founder-title">
            Dr. Frank Alberto <span class="gradient-text">Betances Reinoso</span>
          </h2>

          <p class="founder-lead">
            FEA de Otorrinolaringología Infantil (Hospital Ribera Polusa Lugo / CHUO Ourense), Doctorando e Investigador en Salud Digital (USC). Frank encarna <strong>"La Tríada"</strong> que sostiene la ventaja competitiva y el rigor sanitario de Earlify Health:
          </p>

          <div class="triad-grid">
            <div class="triad-item">
              <div class="triad-num">1</div>
              <div class="triad-text">
                <strong>1. Médico Asistencial</strong>
                <p>Otorrinolaringólogo pediátrico en trinchera hospitalaria. Conoce de primera mano la sobrecarga asistencial, las limitaciones temporales de exploración y la angustia de las familias atrapadas en listas de espera de atención temprana.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="triad-item">
              <div class="triad-num">2</div>
              <div class="triad-text">
                <strong>2. Investigador Clínico</strong>
                <p>Doctorando en la Universidade de Santiago de Compostela (USC), centrado en la rehabilitación digital del lenguaje, biomarcadores acústicos y evaluación de software médico conforme al marco regulatorio MDR e IEC 62304.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="triad-item">
              <div class="triad-num">3</div>
              <div class="triad-text">
                <strong>3. Emprendedor HealthTech</strong>
                <p>Fundador y CEO de Earlify Health S.L. Liderazgo y capacidad técnica de ejecución para transformar la necesidad médica empírica en soluciones SaMD y dispositivos AIoT rigurosos, escalables y auditables.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Cierre Canónico del Fundador -->
          <div class="founder-quote-box">
            <div class="founder-tagline">“Menos ruido. Más criterio.”</div>
            <p class="founder-quote">
              “Conocemos el problema porque lo padecemos todos los días.”
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="founder-actions">
            <a href={`${baseUrl}/cv`} class="btn-primary">
              <span>Ver Currículum Vítae Completo (CV)</span>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6349-9537" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary">
              <span>ORCID 0000-0002-6349-9537</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .earlify-founder {
    position: relative;
    padding: 80px 0 110px 0;
  }

  .founder-card {
    padding: 3.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9) 0%, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7) 100%);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .founder-top {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .avatar-wrapper {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .avatar-ring {
    width: 170px;
    height: 170px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-purple), var(--accent-cyan));
    padding: 4px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35);
  }

  .avatar-content {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--bg-dark);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .avatar-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .founder-info {
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .badge-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .founder-title {
    font-size: 2.65rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .founder-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .founder-lead strong {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .triad-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .triad-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .triad-num {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
    color: var(--accent-purple);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .triad-text strong {
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .triad-text p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .founder-quote-box {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.06);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-cyan);
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .founder-tagline {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .founder-quote {
    font-size: 1.18rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .founder-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .founder-top {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .badge-row, .founder-actions {
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .triad-item {
      text-align: left;
    }
    .founder-card {
      padding: 2.25rem 1.75rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .founder-card {
      padding: 1.75rem 1.2rem;
    }
    .founder-title {
      font-size: 1.95rem;
    }
    .avatar-ring {
      width: 130px;
      height: 130px;
    }
    .founder-actions a {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
